## Edge evidence classification

- **Verified:** documented source-to-source relationship or merged implementation.
- **Derived:** deterministic projection from canonical source records.
- **Proposed:** open PR, proposal, or integration contract awaiting promotion and runtime proof.
- **Unresolved:** relationship whose owner or evidence is currently unestablished.

This map is an architecture projection. Each edge requires a source reference in the organ registry or a linked implementation record. The dashed edges remain proposals until exact-head checks and runtime evidence establish them.
